  "title": "When Solar Meets Science - The Role of PV Monitoring in Applied Research",
  "summary": "The line between technological innovation and applied research is becoming increasingly thin in today’s energy landscape. A concrete example comes from two experimental projects that employ Tigo technology to collect high-resolution performance data at the module level. These projects are promoted by E4C, one installed at the SIRTA atmospheric observatory, in Paris region, and the other is at the UPF Campus.",
